*> vybe-test: cobol/special_registers/test_length_of
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_special_registers.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-STR PIC X(10) VALUE "HELLO".
01 WS-GROUP.
   05 WS-A PIC X(3).
   05 WS-B PIC X(7).
01 WS-LEN PIC 9(3).
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    COMPUTE WS-LEN = FUNCTION LENGTH(WS-STR).
    DISPLAY WS-LEN.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-LEN DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "010"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [010] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    COMPUTE WS-LEN = FUNCTION LENGTH(WS-GROUP).
    DISPLAY WS-LEN.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-LEN DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "010"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [010] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

